      "summary": "The bill creates a tiered Public Service Loan Forgiveness for Federal Direct Loans made after enactment, forgiving 15% increments and full balance after 120 qualifying payments. It covers borrowers employed in certified public service jobs, requires employment certification (including self\u2011certification), cancels interest on forgiven amounts, and auto\u2011defers loans during processing.",
