    "impact": {
      "summary": "Bill requires Department of Education to cancel parts of Federal Direct Loans for borrowers in qualifying public service jobs (government and qualifying nonprofits). It cancels 15% after each 24 payments through 96, forgives remaining balance after 120, requires ED certification, cancels interest, and defers loans.",
